\'a0 \'a0 \'a0Calling procedure:\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a01. Meet at the designated frequency and call roll, but\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a02. if the frequency is occupied:\'a0 I will QSY UP 2 kHz and try again.\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a03. If that frequency is occupied, I will QSY UP 2 kHz MORE and try\
\'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 again, etc.....\
\
